<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fixing, putting together</i>, esp. of woodwork, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					280d
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>fixing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀναφορικοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					24.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				2.196
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>solidity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆξιν λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			 (but metaph., acquire <i>fixity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.138
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				56
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>coagulation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				32a
			</span></i>; <i>freezing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος] π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.49U.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				p.45
			</span></i> U.; caused by cold, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆξις,
				διάχυσις, ζέσις</span> by heat, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				382b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GC</u>
				330b27
			</span></i> (but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θερμότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			); <i>formation of gum</i> in plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.1.5
			</span></i>; <i>curdling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.81
				</span></i>
			.</div>
